  "docTitle": "Stock Broker App (Zerodha / Groww) - SDE Prep Dojo",
  "description": "Design the broker side of a trading app like Zerodha or Groww: live price fan-out to millions of users, order placement with a 10 ms SLA, GTT orders that never get lost, intraday auto square-off, OHLC candles, and extending to many exchanges and segments.",
  "hero": {
