    "attrs": {
      "class": "page-hero"
    },
    "html": "\n        <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n          <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"5\">Level 5 - Interview-ready</span>\n          <span class=\"time\">50 min</span>\n          <span class=\"chip accent\">HLD design</span>\n          <span class=\"chip kafka\">Kafka</span>\n          <span class=\"chip company\">Groww</span><span class=\"chip company\">Paytm</span><span class=\"chip company\">Goldman Sachs</span>\n        </div>\n        <h1>Stock Broker App (Zerodha / Groww)</h1>\n        <p class=\"lead\">Design the app millions of people use to watch prices and trade: a live price stream that is never more than half a second old, orders that reach the exchange in milliseconds, \"Good Till Triggered\" orders that are never lost, and a risk engine that closes losing intraday trades on its own. This is the broker, not the exchange.</p>\n      "
  },
